, and how long will it last?\",\"request_context\":{\"query_identity\":\"b1ccc2a94714fd8c501337a5224a8a532d2bc06e796bc512373007496bed8fa8\",\"algorithm_version\":\"dagbt_joint_memory_v1\",\"program_identity\":\"2fa1fc0a176b2a5dea452479f7ecb6cd2693452867690a5e0b296fc897477f4f\",\"initial_dag_identity\":\"049d04d3c7448748f1d804d1c1ad6c3aa3b89e81f724b23cd3eeca85f34b026c\"},\"variables\":{\"funding_program\":{\"type\":\"entity\",\"demand\":\"project_info\",\"open\":true,\"scope\":{\"entity_scope\":\"SUPPLY project involving EHA\",\"time_scope\":\"project specification\"}},\"start_date\":{\"type\":\"text\",\"demand\":\"project_info\",\"open\":true,\"scope\":{\"entity_scope\":\"SUPPLY project involving EHA\",\"time_scope\":\"project specification\"}},\"duration\":{\"type\":\"text\",\"demand\":\"project_info\",\"open\":true,\"scope\":{\"entity_scope\":\"SUPPLY project involving EHA\",\"time_scope\":\"project specification\"}}},\"requested_slots\":[\"funding_program\",\"start_date\",\"duration\"],\"requested_scopes\":{\"funding_program\":{\"entity_scope\":\"SUPPLY project involving EHA\",\"time_scope\":\"project specification\"},\"start_date\":{\"entity_scope\":\"SUPPLY project involving EHA\",\"time_scope\":\"project specification\"},\"duration\":{\"entity_scope\":\"SUPPLY project involving EHA\",\"time_scope\":\"project specification\"}},\"output_contract\":{\"mode\":\"value\",\"result_type\":\"record\",\"entity_scope\":\"SUPPLY project involving EHA\",\"time_scope\":\"project specification\",\"explanation\":\"none\",\"fields\":[\"funding_program\",\"start_date\",\"duration\"]},\"program_revision\":0,\"rule_binding\":null,\"supported_parents\":{},\"known_observations\":[],\"source_spans\":[[\"s255\",\"d1\",4283,4656,\"How to apply for an EHA Innovation Grant\\nEHA Innovation Grant review and selection process\\nHow to apply for an EHA Innovation Grant\\nHere you will find an overview of the actions you’ll need to take when submitting an EHA Innovation Grant application. You can also refer to our Innovation Grants Application Checklist.\\nBefore you begin\\nMake sure you’ve read and understood:\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s254\",\"d1\",3896,4283,\"Non-EHA funding opportunities\\nScope of our grants\\nTopics-in-Focus program\\nPrecision Hematology Topics-in-Focus program\\nHemoglobinopathies Topics-in-Focus program\\nCongress\\nHemaSphere\\nAbout EHA\\nSearch\\nJoin EHA\\nLogin\\nHome\\nResearch & Innovation\\nGrants\\nEHA Innovation Grant\\nHow to apply for an EHA Innovation Grant\\nLeft Sidebar\\n5 min read · May 6, 2025\\nMay 6, 2025\\nShare\\nEHA Innovation Grant\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s256\",\"d1\",4656,4948,\"The information on eligibility and how you can use the funding on the main EHA Innovation Grant page\\nOur policy on life events\\nOur policy on double awarding\\nYou’ll also need to share our EHA Innovation Grant Agreement Template with your heads of department and institutional representatives. \",\"document\",[]],[\"s257\",\"d1\",4948,5298,\"It’s important that these individuals include a statement, in their support letters, that they understand and agree to the conditions in the grant agreement from the outset.\\nPlease note that at this stage you do not need to fill in the grant agreement template or get it signed.\\nEHA Portal account\\nTo apply, you must be registered on the EHA Portal.\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s258\",\"d1\",5298,5659,\"Only one principal investigator (PI 1) must submit the application on behalf of the collaboration. However, all PIs must create separate profiles on the EHA Portal and provide personal details.\\nIf you already have an EHA Portal account\\nYou can either:\\nLog in using your existing credentials\\nSelect ‘Reset or create password’ if you cannot remember your details\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s259\",\"d1\",5659,6016,\"When you log in, make sure you use the email address that EHA has on file.\\nIf you do not have an EHA Portal account\\nGo to the EHA Portal and follow the steps under the ‘Create your user profile’ heading.\\nPlease keep in mind that, once you register, it may take up to two business days before your registration is processed and you get access to the system.\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s260\",\"d1\",6016,6410,\"Registrations are approved from Monday to Friday between 09:00 and 16:00, Amsterdam time.\\nIf you submit your application after the deadline date due to late EHA Portal registration, it will not be considered.\\nIf you need help with EHA Portal\\nIf you experience issues with registration or accessing your account, our Grants team can help. You can email us at [email protected].\\nApplication form\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s261\",\"d1\",6410,6766,\"To apply for an EHA Innovation Grant, you should complete the application form on the EHA Portal.\\nYou will find the instructions on the platform.\\nBudget information\\nAs part of your application, you must tell us about your project’s budget.\\nOn the application form, please include the following in the ‘budget’ section:\\nMaximum required funding\\nItemization\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s262\",\"d1\",6766,7070,\"Explanation—for example, for equipment, you should provide details about the kind of equipment needed and how it will be used to further the aims of the project\\nThe justification should also include a clear overview of how the funds will be shared between the PIs, including the total allocation per PI.\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s263\",\"d1\",7070,7423,\"Please note that final budgets are subject to approval by EHA’s Fellowships and Grants Committee.\\nDocuments you must submit\\nAs part of your application, you also must submit the following documents. All documents must be in PDF format.\\nJoint project proposal\\nYou’ll need to submit a joint project proposal based on this Joint Project Proposal template. \",\"document\",[]],[\"s264\",\"d1\",7423,7794,\"If you use a different format or go over the specified page limit, your application will be ineligible.\\nPlease save your proposal as: “PI1 full name_ProjectProposal.pdf”\\nPIs’ CVs\\nPlease combine the two CVs into a single PDF and save it as: “PI1 full name_CVs.pdf”\\nEach CV should be no longer than two pages and include the following information.\\nEducation and employment\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s265\",\"d1\",7794,8164,\"Position title (current position at the institute)\\nPrevious positions and employment\\nEducation (including MD/PhD/hematology training graduation dates)\\nExplanation of career breaks\\nJunior/ Senior PI\\nOther experience\\nOther experience and professional memberships\\nHonors and awards\\nPublications\\nFive top publications—with full citation and the impact factor of the journal\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s266\",\"d1\",8164,8466,\"Selected peer-reviewed publications—up to ten\\nTotal citations (Google Scholar)\\nH-index according to Google Scholar\\nOther projects\\nList of other projects for which you are a PI\\nLetters of support\\nPlease combine the following documents into a single PDF and save it as: “PI1 full name_SupportLetters.pdf\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s267\",\"d1\",8466,8787,\"Each page should have a page number, the applicant’s name, and project title in the header or footer.\\n1. Letters from department heads\\nYou must include letters from the department heads of all institutes. These letters should be on institute letterheads, and be no longer than two pages each.\\nEach letter should include:\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s268\",\"d1\",8787,9055,\"A description of the institutional commitment and facilities to support the project\\nA description of how the proposed project will fit into the current research of the department\\nCommitment of the institute to the potential follow up project resulting from this grant\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s269\",\"d1\",9055,9348,\"An acceptance statement that makes it clear that possible overhead costs for this EHA grant will be paid for with funds other than the grant\\nA statement that confirms the institute has read the EHA Innovation Grant Agreement Template and accepts the conditions as they appear on EHA’s website\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s270\",\"d1\",9348,9715,\"The department head’s signature—or the signature of the institute director, in cases where the applicant is the head of the department\\nPlease note that at this stage you do not need to fill in the grant agreement template or get it signed.\\n2. Signed statements of institutional support\\nYou must include signed statements of institutional support from each institute. \",\"document\",[]],[\"s271\",\"d1\",9715,10060,\"These letters should be on institute letterheads, and be no longer than one page each.\\nEach letter should include:\\nA statement that confirms the institute has read the EHA Innovation Grant Agreement Template and accepts the conditions as they appear on EHA’s website\\nA signature by the legally mandated administrative authority of the institute\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s272\",\"d1\",10060,10412,\"Please note that at this stage you do not need to fill in the grant agreement template or get it signed.\\nWhat happens after you apply for an EHA Innovation Grant\\nYou can find out what happens after you submit an application by reading our page about the review and selection process.\\nShare\\nEHA Innovation Grant\\nHow to apply for an EHA Innovation Grant\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s273\",\"d1\",10412,10811,\"EHA Innovation Grant review and selection process\\nJoin EHA\\nFull membership\\nJunior membership\\n60-day trial\\nGet involved\\nCareer development\\nScientific meetings\\nAbout us\\nMission and vision\\nJobs\\nSponsor EHA\\nContact us\\nFollow us\\nPrivacy statement\\nTerms and conditions\\nSubscribe\\nCopyright © 2026\\nBecome an EHA Mentor\\nEHA Mentorship Program\\nDiscover the rewards of mentoring\\nApply by October 29\\nApply today\",\"document\",[]],[\"s244\",\"d1\",0,394,\"How to apply for an EHA Innovation Grant - The European Hematology Association (EHA)How to apply for an EH